{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35874","headline":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 二 · 李咸用","name":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云泉日日长松寺，丝管年年细柳营。\n静躁殊途知自识，荣枯一贯亦何争。\n道傍病树人从老，溪上新苔我独行。\n若见净名居士语，逍遥全不让庄生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}